A **carrier** is a concrete value or type that carries a piece of the mathematics. Normalized
typed RMN is the semantic object; deterministic CBOR, RDF datasets, JSON-LD, EIP-712, and
protocol messages are lawful carriers only when their conformance projections preserve that
